            "review_title": "Review at Barocco Club",
            "review_text": "Pania\n2 contributions\n0\nThey will try to rip you off\nJan 2021 • Friends\nWent there on the new year Eve because all the rooftop bar in the area was full and friend suggested me to go to this club. I went with my sister, we only wanted to have some fun time in the New Year Eva. \n\nArrived and a staff advised for a combo of 10 Heniken beer and 1 fruit dish only 500k. I was surprised with the cost but I understand they would have 10% more of service cost or maybe some a bit more. \n\nMe and my sister tried to stay a bit but the music so loud and not even good, many staff always around us, one staff guy even stayed and took our beers to drink and serve beer for us but we didn't ask for it and feel quite uncomfortable also. \n\nBecause we didn't enjoy so I asked to check bill even only 20' more was New Year Eve, we returned 5 can of beers, and they give us a bill of more than 2 millions. Such a scam, do not go there if you don't know how to protect yourself from those scammer.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 1, 2021",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
